WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.204 --> 00:00:17.833
"Did you have fun at the apple orchard on Saturday?"

2
00:00:18.253 --> 00:00:19.454
Nina asked Izzie.

3
00:00:20.315 --> 00:00:22.156
They were on their way to Kids Central.

4
00:00:22.176 --> 00:00:25.358
"It was so fun!"

5
00:00:25.718 --> 00:00:26.358
Izzie said.

6
00:00:26.378 --> 00:00:29.300
"We picked all kinds of apples.

7
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.683
Green, yellow, red And we put them in cute wooden barrels."

8
00:00:39.045 --> 00:00:40.546
The girls walked into the gym.

9
00:00:45.228 --> 00:00:46.229
Just like those!"

10
00:00:50.771 --> 00:00:53.293
Izzie pointed to a small barrel on the table.

11
00:00:54.173 --> 00:00:55.394
It was filled with apples.

12
00:00:55.414 --> 00:00:58.896
"Welcome, girls," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:01.917
"I went apple picking this weekend!"

14
00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:04.139
"Me too!"

15
00:01:04.599 --> 00:01:05.819
Izzie told their teacher.

16
00:01:05.839 --> 00:01:10.422
"The apples are for our activity today," Miss Shelly said.

17
00:01:10.442 --> 00:01:12.103
"Let me guess.

18
00:01:13.044 --> 00:01:14.564
Are we making applesauce?"

19
00:01:15.065 --> 00:01:15.685
Izzie asked.

20
00:01:16.706 --> 00:01:18.567
Miss Shelly grinned and shook her head.

21
00:01:18.587 --> 00:01:20.848
"Apple juice!"

22
00:01:21.408 --> 00:01:22.029
said Nina.

23
00:01:22.049 --> 00:01:29.020
"We're making apple stamps to decorate lunch bags," explained Miss Shelly.

24
00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:30.221
"How do you make an apple stamp?"

25
00:01:30.681 --> 00:01:31.442
asked Ethan.

26
00:01:31.462 --> 00:01:37.446
"You cut an apple in half and dip it in paint," Miss Shelly explained.

27
00:01:37.466 --> 00:01:40.588
"Then you can use it just like a stamp.

28
00:01:41.669 --> 00:01:43.250
First we'll stamp the lunch bags.

29
00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:47.032
Then you can glue beads and buttons on them too.

30
00:01:48.193 --> 00:01:49.974
First cut the apple in half.

31
00:01:50.975 --> 00:01:54.517
Then press the cut-side onto a paper towel to dry it off.

32
00:01:55.658 --> 00:01:58.580
Ethan, would you please pass the paper towels around?"

33
00:01:58.952 --> 00:01:59.913
Miss Shelly asked.

34
00:02:03.636 --> 00:02:05.497
Izzie glanced at the jars of paint.

35
00:02:06.838 --> 00:02:08.239
"What colors are we using?"

36
00:02:08.259 --> 00:02:12.662
"We have all the basic colors," Miss Shelly said.

37
00:02:12.682 --> 00:02:15.985
"If you want to make more colors, just mix them!

38
00:02:16.725 --> 00:02:17.446
Ready to start?"

39
00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:21.429
"I want to make the perfect green," Izzie thought.

40
00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.592
Miss Shelly passed out paper plates for the paint.

41
00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.141
"Press your apple into the paint.

42
00:02:33.522 --> 00:02:36.724
Then press it firmly onto the fabric," she said.

43
00:02:36.744 --> 00:02:39.466
"Hold it down for a few seconds.

44
00:02:40.447 --> 00:02:44.809
You want to make sure the whole stamp stamps!"

45
00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:48.932
Izzie poured blue paint onto her plate.

46
00:02:49.872 --> 00:02:51.853
Then she added some yellow and mixed.

47
00:02:54.435 --> 00:02:55.936
Next she added a little white.

48
00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.981
Finally she was ready to paint.

49
00:03:02.122 --> 00:03:04.664
She dipped her apple in the paint and stamped.

50
00:03:05.966 --> 00:03:09.789
She was pressing and pressing when her hand slipped!

51
00:03:09.849 --> 00:03:10.449
"Oh no!"

52
00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:11.530
she cried.

53
00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:15.914
"Ha-ha! It looks like a shooting star," Ethan said.

54
00:03:15.934 --> 00:03:18.135
"A shooting apple!"

55
00:03:18.456 --> 00:03:19.136
Bobby said.

56
00:03:19.156 --> 00:03:23.540
"Miss Shelly, Izzie made a cool shooting apple!"

57
00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:24.601
Nina said.

58
00:03:24.621 --> 00:03:29.356
"It doesn't look cool," moaned Izzie.

59
00:03:29.376 --> 00:03:30.397
"It looks dumb!"

60
00:03:30.417 --> 00:03:33.419
"Well, I think it looks cool!"

61
00:03:33.819 --> 00:03:34.480
said Nina.

62
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.842
"I'm going to make one too!"

63
00:03:36.862 --> 00:03:42.666
"I think your apple stamp looks very artistic," said Miss Shelly.

64
00:03:42.686 --> 00:03:46.408
"Thanks," Izzie said.

65
00:03:46.428 --> 00:03:50.011
"But I'm going to make a regular stamp now."

66
00:03:51.112 --> 00:03:52.533
She stamped her bag again.

67
00:03:54.074 --> 00:03:55.535
This time it was perfect.

68
00:03:55.795 --> 00:04:01.973
"Ta-da!" Izzie held up her bag with one shooting apple and one regular apple.

69
00:04:03.433 --> 00:04:06.674
Next Izzie made a tiny stem and a leaf with beads.

70
00:04:07.635 --> 00:04:09.775
Then she wrote her name at the bottom of the bag.

71
00:04:13.076 --> 00:04:17.377
She wanted everyone to know this was her very artistic lunch bag.

72
00:04:20.698 --> 00:04:23.579
Later everyone sat on the rug munching apples.

73
00:04:23.599 --> 00:04:28.506
"Ha! This apple is a funny shape," Jason cried.

74
00:04:28.526 --> 00:04:32.612
"It's not a funny shape," Izzie said.

75
00:04:33.553 --> 00:04:35.376
She looked at Miss Shelly and smiled.

76
00:04:35.396 --> 00:04:37.539
"It's artistic."
